        <mxCell id="note" value="A read takes the publication guard only for its freshness step. Under catch_up it runs one&lt;br&gt;catch-up pass, drops the guard, then answers from one pinned read transaction. The answer&lt;br&gt;stamp lists attested projection families and live parts. A failed catch-up answers at the&lt;br&gt;stored serial with policy word catch_up_failed." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
